  "vulnerability_information": "Dear Team,\nThere is password change issue with bridge.cspr.ng\n\nIssue:\n-------------\nUser is not receiving notification when he/she reset password via password reset link.\nwhen user change his info like password change. User doesn't get email notification for password change etc.\nIt will be a good practice to always send email notification for user for any user related info update.\n\nPlease let me know if more details required.\n\nI hope you will fix it soon!\n\nRegards,\nAhsan Tahir",
